====Statistics====
* According to the 2010 United States Census, ''Salvador'' is the 2,772<sup>nd</sup> most common surname in the United States, belonging to 13,021 individuals. ''Salvador'' is most common among Hispanic/Latino (58.07%), Asian/Pacific Islander (23.02%) and White (13.97%) individuals.

